meta {
  name: Ping
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/apis/{{site}}/api/copilot/ping
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Ping

  Trivial liveness probe for `GET /api/copilot/ping` — confirms the module
  route is wired, the guarded route registrar's ACL check passes
  (`patients`/`demo`, AUDIT S5), and the OAuth2 token carries the
  `user/ping.read` scope. Always returns `{"status": "ok"}`; no dependency
  checks (use the Ready request for that). Not part of a clinical flow —
  useful as a first smoke check before running Turn/Document/Source.
}
